{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young man conscripted into the Finnish military.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Finland, service is mandatory \u2014 and you don\u2019t know how it\u2019s going to play out. You\u2019ll have to get used to a new setting and new rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions shape how things turn out \u2014 for you, and for those around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-rich experience with elements of <strong>drama</strong>, <strong>comedy</strong>, and <strong>romance</strong>\u2026 if you can call it that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <i>Part One</i> of a multi-part story. It is a standalone release, and future parts will be released separately. Stay tuned for updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: around 1 hour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available for Windows</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683010?t=1749364267","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683010?t=1749364267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683010/8952a69124c5ccd4940b939bceb3473bc6c208bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749364267","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683010/8952a69124c5ccd4940b939bceb3473bc6c208bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749364267","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game contains nudity, alcohol use, mild text-based violence, and suggestive dialogue implying sexual activity."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young man conscripted into the Finnish military.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Finland, service is mandatory \u2014 and you don\u2019t know how it\u2019s going to play out. You\u2019ll have to get used to a new settin